# Microsoft Excel Office & Data Management Portfolio

A collection of practical Microsoft Excel projects designed to demonstrate skills in office data management, record keeping, reporting, organization, and spreadsheet development.

## Portfolio Overview

This portfolio contains realistic Excel-based office and data management projects covering common administrative and business tasks. Each project demonstrates the practical application of Excel functions, formulas, formatting, data organization, and workbook design.

## Projects

| Project                         | Description                                                          |
| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 01. Customer Database           | Organizes and manages customer information in a structured database. |
| 02. Employee Information System | Manages employee records and related information.                    |
| 03. Attendance Tracker          | Records and monitors employee attendance.                            |
| 04. Sales Record Tracker        | Organizes sales transactions and supports sales monitoring.          |
| 05. Invoice Register            | Records and tracks invoice information and payment status.           |
| 06. Student Grade Calculator    | Calculates and organizes student grades and results.                 |
| 07. Personal Budget Tracker     | Tracks income, expenses, and personal budgeting information.         |
| 08. Task and To-Do Manager      | Organizes tasks, priorities, deadlines, and completion status.       |

